  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 5pt 0cm 0cm 36pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed rear dormer\r\nextension in conjunction with the existing original first floor rear extension,\r\nby reason of inappropriate design, cumulative excessive bulk and massing would\r\nresult in an unduly obtrusive and incongruous addition that would poorly relate\r\nto the existing first floor rear addition and that would appear visually\r\ncramped, detracting from the character of its semi-detached pair and properties\r\nin the surrounding area. The rear dormer would thereby unacceptably harm the\r\ncharacter of the original dwellinghouse and the visual amenities of the area,\r\ncontrary to the high quality design aspirations set out in The National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3 (D(1) and D(11)) of The London\r\nPlan (2021), Policy CS1.B on the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the\r\nDevelopment Management Local Plans Policies (2013) and Supplementary Planning\r\nDocument: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;PT Sans&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
